1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,340
♪♪♪

2
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:18,640
♪ I was a thief in the garden of God. ♪

3
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:24,820
♪ Hands full of fig leaves, heart full of fraud. ♪

4
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:31,020
♪ Running from love that had named me his child. ♪

5
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:36,900
♪ Calling me back through the dark and the wild. ♪

6
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:43,400
♪ You walked the road I paved with my shame. ♪

7
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:49,580
♪ Carried a cross that was carved with my name. ♪

8
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:55,340
♪ Nails through your hands where my blame should have been. ♪

9
00:00:55,340 --> 00:01:00,680
♪ You drank the depth of my personal sin. ♪

10
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:06,760
♪ You poured out blood in my place. You looked straight into my face. ♪

11
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:12,900
♪ Saw every wound that I tried to hide away. You took my hell, gave me your name. ♪

12
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:21,940
♪ You broke my chains with your grace. You are the passionate love that will not let me escape. ♪

13
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:28,740
♪ Jesus, you're the one who won my heart from the grave. ♪

14
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:41,300
♪ I hear you speak through the scar on your side. This is the door, come and step into life. ♪

15
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:52,660
♪ Mercy like thunder yet soft as a breath. Gently untying the knots in my chest. ♪

16
00:01:52,660 --> 00:02:04,340
♪ How can this be that all of my failure fell into the sea? Watch in the moment when you chose the nails for me. ♪

17
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:16,340
♪ You poured out blood in my place. You looked straight into my face. Saw every wound that I tried to hide away. You took my hell, gave me your name. ♪

18
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:30,500
♪ You broke my chains with your grace. You are the passionate love that will not let me escape. Jesus, you're the one who won my heart from the grave. ♪

19
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:58,100
♪ For the liar, for the proud. For the quiet ones burning out. For the bitter, for the blind. For the ones just like I am. For the orphaned, for the used. For the heart that thinks it's through. For the angry, for the ash. For the one I see in the glass. ♪

20
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:21,860
♪ You say, Beloved, this is for you. I took your death to give you truth. You say, Beloved, lift up your head. I walked out living so you can live. ♪

21
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:47,300
♪ You poured out blood in my place. You looked straight into my face. Saw every wound that I tried to hide away. You took my hell, gave me your name. You broke my chains with your grace. You are the passionate love that will not let me escape. Jesus, you're the one who won my heart from the grave. ♪

22
00:03:47,300 --> 00:04:17,300
♪ Here at your cross, I finally see. You gave your life for all for me. Here at your cross, I finally know. I am the joy you endured. You chose my soul. ♪

23
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:25,020
♪
